# Deadlock cheat sheet (mine, for the exam formula sheet)

Coffman: mutual exclusion, hold & wait, no preemption, circular wait. ALL four needed.
Prevention: break one. Avoidance: Banker's (safe state). Detection: cycle in wait-for graph. Recovery: kill/rollback.
RAG with single instances: cycle ⇔ deadlock. Multiple instances: cycle is necessary, not sufficient.
Banker's safety: Work = Avail; find i with Need_i ≤ Work; Work += Alloc_i; repeat.
